text Naranja_TrovitaIsland_House3_Text_08185584 {
    "For my own POKéMON, I give them\nperfectly suited nicknames!\pIt’s my expression of, uh...\noriginality, yes, that’s it!"
}

text Naranja_TrovitaIsland_House3_Text_081855FA {
    "But giving the name PEKACHU to a\nPIKACHU? It seems pointless.\pI suppose it is good to use a name\nthat’s easy to understand, but..."
}

text Naranja_TrovitaIsland_House3_Text_0818567D {
